  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Robert Carr Civil Society Network Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To provide support to the Robert Carr Civil Networks Fund in order that civil society networks, working at global and regional levels, have sufficient and predictable resources to enhance the quality, effectiveness and gender equity of the HIV response [universal access to prevention, treatment, care and support without stigma or discrimination], especially in reaching inadequately served populations at local level.</narrative>
  </description>
